# binder — шаги записи (что показывается — binder.md)
# Его замечание 2026-10-05: три этапа — новая команда в Binder (вставка →), её применение в строке,
# затем Smart bracket. Имя команды заполняется само из выбора (`Arrow right` → id `arrow-right`).
title Binder | Your own text on a key, and smart brackets
open Reading list.md
caret - Lisbon travel guide
stage New Binder command
settings Keyboard
spot Smart bracket #1
say This is Binder — text you drop in with one key
pause 2200
click Add command
fill Type anything or choose below = →
say Inserts → the arrow; the name fills itself in
pause 800
click Add
pause 1000
close
stage Use it in a line
caret - Lisbon travel guide
say Its key drops → in at the cursor
key Space
cmd arrow-right
key Space
type book the hotel
expect - Lisbon travel guide → book the hotel
stage Smart bracket
caret - Notes on the garden @ garden
say Smart bracket: [text], then [[text]], then back
cmd smart-bracket
cmd smart-bracket
cmd smart-bracket
select - Notes on the garden @ the garden
say It works on a selection too
cmd smart-bracket
cmd smart-bracket
expect - Notes on [[the garden]]
